{"id":"2475fe680fce5481","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-prop-union-definition.md","title":"Union Definition","display":"prop-union-definition — Union Definition","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-union-definition","aliases":["58-prop-union-definition"],"display":"prop-union-definition — Union Definition","depends_on":["[[58-df-union-gen]]","[[58-df-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-union-definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-union-definition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-union-definition — Union Definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"155dfdcd961bd88a\" href=\"?note=155dfdcd961bd88a\" title=\"58-df-union-gen\">58-df-union-gen</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\in V\\)</span> (set whose members are to be unioned)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}union-definition} \\vdash \\forall x\\in V\\;\\Bigl(x\\in\\bigcup\\mathcal F\\leftrightarrow\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(x\\in A)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}union-definition} \\vdash \\forall x\\in V\\;\\Bigl(x\\in\\bigcup\\mathcal F\\leftrightarrow\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(x\\in A)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The generalized union of a set is the set of all elements belonging to some member; no one-argument family predicate is needed.</li>\n<li>Binary union is the special case <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F} = \\{A, B\\}\">\\(\\mathcal{F} = \\{A, B\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-union-gen","status":"resolved","id":"155dfdcd961bd88a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-union-gen]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}union-definition} \\vdash \\forall x\\in V\\;\\Bigl(x\\in\\bigcup\\mathcal F\\leftrightarrow\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(x\\in A)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F} = \\{A, B\\}","display":false}],"bytes":757,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4010","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-prop-union-definition.md|58-prop-union-definition]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["155dfdcd961bd88a","65d9a1e690c32aad"]}